    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρτ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρτη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				220c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				520.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ τοῦ κ. πλέγματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					79d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε ἐγρηγορόσιν μήτε εὕδουσι
				κύρτοις ἀργὸν θήραν διαπονουμένοις</span>
			<i>weels</i> that secure a lazy prey for men whether asleep or
			awake, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				823e
			</span></i> (hence prov. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὕδοντι κ. αἱρεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diogenian.
					4.65
				</span></i>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				86.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρτῳ θηρεύουσι τοὺς ἰχθῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					603a7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bird-cage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυγοτευχής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.562
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>).</div>
